373	     * Validates an owner's optional postcode. A {@code null} value means the field was omitted and is
374	     * left unset, keeping the create contract backward-compatible. When a value is present it must be
375	     * exactly 4 digits, and when the owner's region (derived from its city, {@link #regionForCity})
376	     * has a known postcode range in {@link #REGION_POSTCODES} the postcode must fall within that
377	     * inclusive range. A region with no known range ({@code 'UNKNOWN'}) accepts any 4-digit postcode.
378	     * The returned value is stored and returned unchanged.
