594	     * Counts the existing owners already in the given city, used to derive the per-city sequence of a
595	     * {@code customerCode}. Cities are compared case-insensitively with surrounding and internal
596	     * whitespace collapsed, consistent with the other owner-field comparisons. The owner being created
597	     * has not been saved yet, so it is never included in the count.
598	     *
599	     * @param city the city of the owner being created
600	     * @return the number of existing owners in that city
601	     */
602	    private int countOwnersInCity(String city) {
603	        String normalizedCity = normalizeForComparison(city);
