625	     * Rejects creation of an owner once the given business day has already reached its daily quota
626	     * of {@value #DAILY_OWNER_LIMIT} owners. Owners are counted by their {@code registrationDate}
627	     * being that day — the adjusted business day the owner being created will carry — so the quota
628	     * applies per business day. The owner being created has not been saved yet, so it is never
629	     * included in the count.
