655	    /**
656	     * Sets the {@code bulkSignupWarning} flag on an owner response. The flag is {@code true} when more
657	     * than {@value #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already carry the current business day's
658	     * {@code registrationDate} — the business day a create would land on right now — and {@code false}
659	     * otherwise.
